    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the thing is, i've tried \"resting.\" i sleep, i take breaks, i try to do nothing... but i wake up and the weight is still there. it's like the battery isn't just low, it's actually broken. i don't think there's any amount of sleep that's gonna fix how i feel. it just feels like a permanent state now.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
